graph TD
  subgraph YOU[YOU - the human who owns it]
    direction TB
    Ask[You ask for work] --> Decide[You decide what done means]
    Decide -->|steer anytime| Course[Change tier, direction, or stop]
  end

  subgraph AGENT[AGENT - the executive brain, inside CLAUDE.md]
    direction TB
    Load[Every turn: read the contract] --> Tier{S2: how big is this task?}
    Tier -->|T0 / T1| Fast[Answer directly / one-file fix]
    Tier -->|T2+| Trigger[S0.4: fire the shards that match]
    Trigger --> Read[S6 first reads: README, build files, CI]
    Read --> Plan[S12: numbered steps written down, not improvised]
    Plan --> Work[S16: build - single thread or swarm of lanes]
    Work --> FastCheck[L0 self-check: does it compile, do my own checks pass]
  end

  subgraph PROOF[THE MACHINE CHECKS - the honest referee]
    direction TB
    L1[S17 L1: run the command again, fresh] --> L2[S19 L2: a blind reviewer who never saw my reasoning]
    L2 --> L3[L3: the real user command, end to end]
    L3 --> Gate{S27: 7-line gate, all quoted?}
    Gate -->|no| Rework[Return to Work - fix with quoted evidence]
    Rework --> L1
  end

  Fast --> Report
  FastCheck --> L1
  Gate -->|yes| Commit[S24: one commit per verified step]
  Commit --> Report[S34: the receipt - tier, changes, proof lines]
  Report --> Feed[S43.6 + weekly audit: the journal cross-checks the claim]
  Feed -->|mismatch| Court[Humans decide: real or smoothed-over]
  Court -->|fixed| Commit
  Course --> Load
  Feed --> Learn[S21: one line of durable lesson saved]

  classDef human fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,stroke-width:2px,color:#451a03
  classDef agent fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e1b4b
  classDef check fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#047857,stroke-width:2px,color:#064e3b
  class Ask,Decide,Course human
  class Load,Tier,Fast,Trigger,Read,Plan,Work,FastCheck agent
  class L1,L2,L3,Gate,Rework,Commit,Report,Feed,Court,Learn check
